==Pipil==

===Alternative forms===
* tē ({{IPA|/ˈteː/|lang=ppl}})
* tēsu ({{IPA|/ˈteːsu̥/|lang=ppl}})

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/inˈteː/|lang=ppl}}

===Adverb===
{{head|ppl|adverb}}

# [[not]]
#: ''[[ina#Pipil|Ina]][[-ki#Pipil|k]] ka '''inte''' ki[[mati#Pipil|mati]]''
#:: ''She/he said she/he '''doesn't''' know''
#: '''''Inte''' [[ni-#Pipil|ni]][[weli#Pipil|weli]] ni[[tekiti#Pipil|tekiti]] [[yek#Pipil|yek]] [[kwak#Pipil|kwak]] ni[[mayana#Pipil|mayana]]''
#:: ''I ca'''n't''' work well when I'm hungry''

===Particle===
{{head|ppl|particle}}

# [[no]], used to deny or disagree.
#: ''[[ti#Pipil|Ti]][[ki-#Pipil|k]][[neki#Pipil|neki]] [[chiupi#Pipil|chiupi]] chukulat? — '''Te''', ni[[kwa#Pipil|kwaj]][[-ya#Pipil|a]] [[wey#Pipil|wey]]''
#:: ''Do you want a piece of chocolate? — '''No''', I already ate a lot''

